mpvpaper-dde (0.1.0-5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * watch: STATE is no longer overwritten by the static-placeholder
    writeback -- a lagging second Changed broadcast used to pierce the
    dedupe and re-takeover the same video (double takeover in the
    journal), racing the UI fallback restart and the control-center
    wallpaper link-up.
  * watch: subscribe to systemd JobRemoved for the engine unit; any
    external restart or on-failure self-recovery now re-raises the
    desktop canvas automatically (the video used to cover the desktop
    icons until the user fixed the stacking by hand).
  * ui: fallback restart now stops the watch service first and brings
    it back last, so the two never race over stop/start sequencing.

 -- arthas276 <22973001+arthas276@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 17:50:00 +0800

