mpvpaper-dde (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * wrapper: run mpvpaper in background + wait, real TERM/INT trap with
    staged exit (IPC quit -> TERM -> 3s grace -> KILL). Fixes lock-screen
    stop hitting the systemd deadline and being recorded as
    Result=timeout (stop now ~1s, Result=success).
  * wrapper: new ensure_lock_sync loop re-aligns mpv pause state with
    login1 LockedHint every 5s. Fixes "stuck paused" when the launcher
    starts while already unlocked (no transition event ever fires).
  * watch: new reconcile loop converges service state from LockedHint +
    want every 20s. Heals missed unlock signals (both dde and login1
    listeners were observed losing the real unlock event).
  * watch: log the skip reason when an unlock is ignored due to
    want != playing.

 -- arthas276 <22973001+arthas276@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 14:55:02 +0800

mpvpaper-dde (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: mpvpaper engine (upstream fc5ed28, unmodified,
